<h2 id=3D"data-distribution" class=3D"max-md:pr-4" data-state=3D"closed" st=
yle=3D"cursor: pointer;">Data distribution</h2>
<p>Each Lattice environment runs an instance of the CDN. In a Lattice mesh =
deployment, every node in the mesh
runs a single instance of the CDN. This lets Lattice retrieve objects using=
 a tiered lookup mechanism:</p>
<figure class=3D"not-prose fern-card rounded-3 relative mb-6 mt-4 overflow-=
hidden p-2 first:mt-0 bg-(color:--grayscale-a2)"><div class=3D"rounded-1 sh=
adow-xs relative flex justify-center overflow-hidden [&amp;_[data-rmiz]]:bl=
ock [&amp;_[data-rmiz]]:w-full [&amp;_[data-rmiz-content]]:block"><span dat=
a-rmiz=3D"" class=3D"relative"><span data-rmiz-content=3D"found"><img class=
=3D"mx-auto" src=3D"https://developer.anduril.com/_fern-img/be83e074bce1b6d=
6be87c091b656fb4863e4a312bf172ffdefe9ff12e9cf4eef.webp" alt=3D"Architectura=
l diagram showing the content-delivery network used by Lattice." width=3D"3=
707" height=3D"2084" style=3D"aspect-ratio: 1.77879 / 1;"></span><button ar=
ia-label=3D"Expand image" data-rmiz-btn-zoom=3D"" type=3D"button"><svg aria=
-hidden=3D"true" fill=3D"currentColor" focusable=3D"false" viewBox=3D"0 0 1=
6 16"><path d=3D"M 9 1 L 9 2 L 12.292969 2 L 2 12.292969 L 2 9 L 1 9 L 1 14=
 L 6 14 L 6 13 L 2.7070312 13 L 13 2.7070312 L 13 6 L 14 6 L 14 1 L 9 1 z">=
</path></svg></button></span></div></figure>
<p>If the requested data is not cached locally, Lattice queries peers at th=
e same layer in the mesh.
If a peer has the data, a request is issued to stream and cache the blob lo=
cally before sending it to the client.
If no peers at the same layer have the requested data, the system queries n=
odes in the next highest layer,
following a specific precedence order.</p>
<h2 id=3D"object-schema" class=3D"max-md:pr-4" data-state=3D"closed" style=
=3D"cursor: pointer;">Object schema</h2>
<p>The Objects API implements the <code>PathMetadata</code> and <code>Conte=
ntIdentifier</code>
schemas to store and retrieve objects across the Lattice environment:</p>
<p><svg xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" prefix=3D"fas" icon=3D"object-=
intersect" viewBox=3D"0 0 512 512" aria-hidden=3D"true" focusable=3D"false"=
