64l224 0c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64l0-224c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64l-96 0 0-96c0-35.3-=
28.7-64-64-64L64 0C28.7 0 0 28.7 0 64L0 288c0 35.3 28.7 64 64 64zM448 224l0=
