<h2 id=3D"object-lifecycle" class=3D"max-md:pr-4" data-state=3D"closed" sty=
le=3D"cursor: pointer;">Object lifecycle</h2>
<p>An object in Lattice has the following lifecycle states:</p>
<!--$--><div class=3D"fern-steps"><!--$--><div class=3D"fern-step" id=3D"cr=
eate"><a data-astro-prefetch=3D"false" class=3D"fern-anchor" href=3D"https:=
//developer.anduril.com/guides/objects/overview#create" tabindex=3D"-1"><sp=
an class=3D"fern-anchor-icon"><span>1</span></span></a><h3>Create</h3><p>Wh=
en you upload an object, Object Store updates the object=E2=80=99s
<a data-astro-prefetch=3D"viewport" class=3D"fern-mdx-link" href=3D"https:/=
/developer.anduril.com/reference/rest/objects/upload-object#response.body.l=
ast_updated_at"><code>last_updated_at</code></a>.</p></div><!--/$--><!--$--=
><div class=3D"fern-step" id=3D"expire"><a data-astro-prefetch=3D"false" cl=
ass=3D"fern-anchor" href=3D"https://developer.anduril.com/guides/objects/ov=
erview#expire" tabindex=3D"-1"><span class=3D"fern-anchor-icon"><span>2</sp=
an></span></a><h3>Expire</h3><p>When an object expires, Object Store automa=
tically deletes it from Lattice.
You can define an <a data-astro-prefetch=3D"viewport" class=3D"fern-mdx-lin=
k" href=3D"https://developer.anduril.com/reference/rest/objects/upload-obje=
ct#response.body.expiry_time%5D"><code>expiry_time</code></a>
by setting the optional <code>Time-to-Live</code> header when uploading the=
 object.
If you associate an object with an entity in Lattice, your app must handle =
resetting the entity=E2=80=99s
<a data-astro-prefetch=3D"viewport" class=3D"fern-mdx-link" href=3D"https:/=
/developer.anduril.com/reference/rest/entities/publish-entity#request.body.=
media"><code>media</code></a> component
accordingly.</p></div><!--/$--><!--$--><div class=3D"fern-step" id=3D"delet=
e"><a data-astro-prefetch=3D"false" class=3D"fern-anchor" href=3D"https://d=
eveloper.anduril.com/guides/objects/overview#delete" tabindex=3D"-1"><span =
class=3D"fern-anchor-icon"><span>3</span></span></a><h3>Delete</h3><p>You c=
an delete an object from Lattice before it expires by using the
<a data-astro-prefetch=3D"viewport" class=3D"fern-mdx-link" href=3D"https:/=
/developer.anduril.com/reference/rest/objects/delete-object"><code>DeleteOb=
ject</code></a> API.
Similar to when an object expires, you must handle resetting the entity=E2=
=80=99s <code>media</code> component
if the object is associated with an entity in Lattice.</p></div><!--/$--></=
div><!--/$-->
